et pons apud Mogontiacum <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> magontiacum  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  mogontiacum
1. mongontiacum B 2. magontiacum 11. maguntiacum  <HI REND="ITALIC">Bouq.</HI></NOTE>  in Reno <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> rheno 4. 11.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Bouq.</HI>  hreno B 2.</NOTE>  quingentorum
passuum longitudinis—nam <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI> 
B 2—5.</NOTE>  tanta est ibi
fluminis latitudo. Qui tamen uno antequam decederet <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> deceret 1.</NOTE> ,
anno incendio conflagravit <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> conflavit 4.</NOTE> , nec refici potuit
propter festinatum illius decessum <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> discessum B 2. 3 b. 3 c.</NOTE> , quanquam in
ea meditatione esset, ut pro ligneo lapideum restitueret.
Inchoavit et palatia operis egregii, unum
haud longe a Mogontiaco <NOTE N="30" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> maguntiaco 3 c. magontiaco 7. 11.
moguntiaco 6 b. 8 b.</NOTE>  civitate, iuxta villam
cuius <NOTE N="31" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> cui 2 b. 2 c. 3 c. 8 b. 6 b. 7. 8. 10. 10 b. 10 c. 11 b. 11 d. 13. B 2—5.</NOTE>  vocabulum <NOTE N="32" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> nomen
7 c? 8 b. 11 d.</NOTE>  est Engilenheim <NOTE N="33" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> ingilenheim 4. 5. 4 b. 6 b. 10. 10 b. 10 c. 11. B 5. ingiletheim B 2. ennigilecheim B 2 *.
