8 b. 11. B 3—4.</NOTE>  exercere
adgressos <NOTE N="43" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> adgressus 1. aggressus B 3. 3 c. 3 d.</NOTE> ; ac per hoc nullo gravi dampno vel Italia a
