1. 2. nardomannis B 2. normannis 3 b. nordimannis B 3 d.  <HI REND="ITALIC">reliqui</HI>  nordmannis  <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>  nortmannis.</NOTE> 
diebus suis affecta est, praeter quod Centumcellae, civitas
Etruriae <NOTE N="46" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> hetruriae
8 b.</NOTE> , per proditionem a Mauris capta atque
vastata est, et in Frisia <NOTE N="47" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> fresia B 5.</NOTE>  quaedam insulae Germanico
littori contiguae a Nortmannis <NOTE N="48" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">vide supra</HI></NOTE>  depraedatae sunt.</P> <P COM="0042">18. Talem <NOTE N="e" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0042" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0042C"></COL> Cf. Suet. Aug., c. 61.</NOTE>  eum in tuendo et ampliando <NOTE N="49" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0041" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0041"></COL> ampliamdo 1. ampliendo 4. amplificando 11.</NOTE>  simulque
