obitum illius annis, in eo quo conversata est monasterio
decessit.</P> <P COM="0044">19. Liberos suos ita <NOTE N="48" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0043" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0043"></COL> ante B 1, 2.</NOTE>  censuit <NOTE N="49" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0043" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0043"></COL> consuit B 2.</NOTE>  instituendos, ut
