otium torperent, operam impendere, atque <NOTE N="53" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0043" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0043"></COL> adque, 2 <HI REND="ITALIC">a manu</HI>  atque 1.</NOTE>  ad
