quem in <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0045" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0045"></COL> in amicis  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest, et secunda manu adiectum</HI>  1.</NOTE>  amicis <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0045" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0045"></COL> in amicitiis 10 c. B 3—5. quem amicum 8 b.</NOTE>  praecipuum habebat, sic flevit <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0045" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0045"></COL> flevit
