Oscelae</HI>  vel  <HI REND="ITALIC">Susa in Savoia,</HI>  in 8 <SUP>o</SUP> , saec. XI ineuntis,
aeque ac proxime sequentes edicta regum Langobardorum
et capitula Caroli Magni, Pippini, Ludovici I,
Lotharii I, Ludovici II detracta, necnon leges Widonis,
