modii 12. Caballum <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0341" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0341"></COL> cababallum  <HI REND="ITALIC">cod.</HI></NOTE>  domitum 1, boves 26, vaccas
