calderas aereas 2, ferrea 1, sartaginem 1, gramalium
1, andedam <NOTE N="g" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0346" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0346D"></COL> Sustentaculum ferreum ligni comburentis.</NOTE>  1, farum 1, secures 2, dolatoriam 1,
