 <COL N="0495A"></COL> vuirthit geaneruun in Selues</HI> <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0495" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0495"></COL> Thesselues.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">neieina
