sich burigun gedue theruselueru geuueri
nio themo geaneruen thegein vrsach beliue
thia sala cebekerine</HI> <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0495" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0495"></COL> Cebeuuandelene.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">sunder mera not analige</HI> 
