thanne sachun sinu bit geaneruun sinen gesunduruth
nehauoda</HI> <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0495" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0495"></COL> nebaboda. neo.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">nesi himo that ceungeu vor
Samithu</HI> <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0495" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0495"></COL> samidu.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">sunder geaneruo siner auo er gerno
