eruetha</HI> <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0495" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0495"></COL> eruida.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">sina vuolda vollacaman</HI> <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0495" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0495"></COL> voloquoman.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">inde auo
sumeuuelicheru samonungun thia sellan bat ganeruo
